{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WR2DD4dtAUTSMeFLtwe8Db","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"Researching: Pottery (2 turns)\\nCivic: Code of Laws (7 turns)\\n\\nAvailable techs:\\n  Pottery (TECH_POTTERY) [ANCIENT] — 75%, 2 turns -> Granary, Great Bath, Mekewap !! GRAB THIS\\n  Animal Husbandry (TECH_ANIMAL_HUSBANDRY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 6 turns -> Pasture, Camp, Kurgan, Reveals Horses\\n  Mining (TECH_MINING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 6 turns -> Mine, Quarry\\n  Sailing (TECH_SAILING) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 12 turns [Boost: Found a city on the Coast.] -> Galley, Viking Longship, Bireme, Fishing Boats, Fishery\\n  Astrology (TECH_ASTROLOGY) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 12 turns [Boost: Find a natural wonder.] -> Shrine, Stonehenge, Holy Site, Lavra\\n\\nAvailable civics:\\n  Code of Laws (CIVIC_CODE_OF_LAWS) [ANCIENT] — 0%, 12 turns\\n\\nLocked techs (prerequisites missing):\\n  -- ANCIENT --\\n  Irrigation (TECH_IRRIGATION) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Farm a resource.]\\n  Archery (TECH_ARCHERY) — needs: Animal Husbandry [Boost: Kill a unit with a Slinger.]\\n  Writing (TECH_WRITING) — needs: Pottery [Boost: Meet another civilization.]\\n  Masonry (TECH_MASONRY) — needs: Mining [Boost: Build a Quarry.]\\n  Bronze Working (TECH_BRONZE_WORKING) — needs: Mining [Boost: Kill 3 Barbarians.]\\n  Wheel (TECH_THE_WHEEL) — needs: Mining [Boost: Mine a resource.]\\n  -- CLASSICAL --\\n  Celestial Navigation (TECH_CELESTIAL_NAVIGATION) — needs: Sailing, Astrology [Boost: Improve 2 sea resources.]\\n  Currency (TECH_CURRENCY) — needs: Writing [Boost: Make a [ICON_TradeRoute] Trade Route.]\\n  Horseback Riding (TECH_HORSEBACK_RIDING) — needs: Archery [Boost: Build a Pasture.]\\n  Iron Working (TECH_IRON_WORKING) — needs: Bronze Working [Boost: Build an Iron Mine.]\\n  Shipbuilding (TECH_SHIPBUILDING) — needs: Sailing [Boost: Own 2 Galleys.]\\n  Mathematics (TECH_MATHEMATICS) — needs: Currency [Boost: Build 3 different specialty districts.]\\n  Construction (TECH_